{"4596180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Table of Fates", "steam_appid": 4596180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/3c80952d23c475bc6fb44ed477e83fd1.poster.avif?t=1782318069\" width=616 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/3c80952d23c475bc6fb44ed477e83fd1.webm?t=1782318069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Tavern!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Table of Fates</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder set in a medieval fantasy tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a traveler taking a break on your journey, only to discover a mysterious card game that the locals can't stop playing. What starts as a simple match quickly becomes something more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a tactical card game on the table, where your hero battles enemy creatures using spells, abilities, and clever combos, adapting your strategy as each encounter unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, face strange opponents, and see how far you can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/8f168277b9dd3fe442251ee58ddb31d0.poster.avif?t=1782318069\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/8f168277b9dd3fe442251ee58ddb31d0.webm?t=1782318069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/8f168277b9dd3fe442251ee58ddb31d0.mp4?t=1782318069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your deck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cards carefully and shape your strategy with every reward. Every choice matters as your deck evolves throughout each battle. Combine cards, experiment with different builds, and adapt to the challenges each run throws at you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new synergies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn simple cards into powerful plays</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/d0472c31a639256acdc49baa848653b0.poster.avif?t=1782318069\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/d0472c31a639256acdc49baa848653b0.webm?t=1782318069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/d0472c31a639256acdc49baa848653b0.mp4?t=1782318069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No two runs feel the same!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game unfolds across different table setups and evolving scenarios within the tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run offers new opportunities and new risks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/4518848c7995687c0136a68d90e6e17e.poster.avif?t=1782318069\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/4518848c7995687c0136a68d90e6e17e.webm?t=1782318069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/4518848c7995687c0136a68d90e6e17e.mp4?t=1782318069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover powerful items!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy relics, drink special brews, and enhance your stats. The right items can drastically change your run, turning simple builds into unstoppable strategies. They also interact with your cards, stats, and other items, unlocking powerful possibilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain passive effects that shape your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your stats to support different builds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create new synergies between cards and items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/8b4b2111371d805b65525e6187183e0c.poster.avif?t=1782318069\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/8b4b2111371d805b65525e6187183e0c.webm?t=1782318069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/8b4b2111371d805b65525e6187183e0c.mp4?t=1782318069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make thoughtful deals!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between matches, you will encounter a series of events as you interact with the tavern's locals. These moments offer choices, opportunities, and risks that can shape the course of your run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with Merchants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink with the Barman</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter beggars, other travelers... and worse</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Not everyone has good intentions.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/af22a75091cc8973ae9a4fd923b6310a.apng?t=1782318069\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/af22a75091cc8973ae9a4fd923b6310a.poster.avif?t=1782318069\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every interaction shapes your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend wisely, act carefully, and think before you refuse...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locals react and remember your behavior, and your Karma will influence:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who you encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How they treat you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What rewards you receive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/dde5ea07e7e9d07095a26c391ddf18b7.webp?t=1782318069\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/dde5ea07e7e9d07095a26c391ddf18b7.poster.avif?t=1782318069\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greed and carelessness can cost you more than just gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk it all... or secure your winnings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any moment, you could be offered the option to sell your deck and walk away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your luck for greater rewards, or play it safe before <strong>everything turns against you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/3c80952d23c475bc6fb44ed477e83fd1.poster.avif?t=1782318069\" width=616 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/3c80952d23c475bc6fb44ed477e83fd1.webm?t=1782318069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Tavern!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Table of Fates</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder set in a medieval fantasy tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a traveler taking a break on your journey, only to discover a mysterious card game that the locals can't stop playing. What starts as a simple match quickly becomes something more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a tactical card game on the table, where your hero battles enemy creatures using spells, abilities, and clever combos, adapting your strategy as each encounter unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, face strange opponents, and see how far you can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/8f168277b9dd3fe442251ee58ddb31d0.poster.avif?t=1782318069\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596180/extras/8f168277b9dd3fe442251ee58ddb31d0.webm?t=1782318069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://